      "content": "one more thing... sometimes when it happens it feels like a really heavy pressure, almost like someone is sitting on my chest for a minute or two. but like i said, it goes away when i rest. i'm just trying to avoid the urgent care because it's a huge hassle and expensive. are you sure it's not something serious since it feels so heavy?",
